{% comment %}
  mp-story — a story page (built for "The cake").

  A monumental full-bleed hero photograph carries a small, quiet title, then a
  lead paragraph, then chapters — each a kicker, a heading, a paragraph or two
  and an illustrating photograph that alternates side to side on desktop. One
  pull-quote at the end. Every string is a setting; every image falls back to a
  labelled stand-in.
{% endcomment %}
{% render 'mp-assets' %}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<div class="mp">
  <section class="mp-story__monument{% unless s.image %} mp-story__monument--ph{% endunless %}" aria-labelledby="mp-story-h-{{ section.id }}">
    {%- if s.image != blank -%}
      {{ s.image | image_url: width: 2600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '100vw', widths: '900,1200,1600,2000,2600', alt: s.image.alt | default: s.title | strip_html }}
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="mp-story__monument-copy">
      <p class="mp-mono mp-mono--accent">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h1 id="mp-story-h-{{ section.id }}" class="mp-story__monument-title">{{ s.title }}</h1>
      {%- if s.location != blank -%}<p class="mp-mono mp-mono--dim">{{ s.location | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- if s.image_caption != blank -%}<figcaption class="mp-story__monument-cap mp-mono mp-mono--dim">{{ s.image_caption | escape }}</figcaption>{%- endif -%}
  </section>

  <div class="mp-wrap mp-flow">
    {%- if s.standfirst != blank -%}
      <p class="mp-deck mp-story__lead mp-reveal">{{ s.standfirst | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="mp-story">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
        <section class="mp-story__chapter mp-reveal" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="mp-story__text">
            {%- if b.kicker != blank -%}<p class="mp-mono mp-mono--accent">{{ b.kicker | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if b.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="mp-h3">{{ b.heading | escape }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if b.body != blank -%}<div class="mp-prose">{{ b.body }}</div>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <figure class="mp-story__fig{% unless b.image %} mp-story__fig--ph{% endunless %}">
            {%- if b.image != blank -%}
              {{ b.image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 46vw, 100vw', widths: '600,900,1200,1600', alt: b.image.alt | default: b.heading }}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if b.image_caption != blank -%}
              <figcaption class="mp-fig__cap">{{ b.image_caption | escape }}</figcaption>
            {%- elsif b.image == blank -%}
              <figcaption class="mp-fig__cap">photograph</figcaption>
            {%- endif -%}
          </figure>
        </section>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- if s.quote != blank -%}
      <blockquote class="mp-story__quote mp-reveal">
        <p>{{ s.quote | escape }}</p>
        {%- if s.quote_by != blank -%}<cite>{{ s.quote_by | escape }}</cite>{%- endif -%}
      </blockquote>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "MP Story",
  "tag": "div",
  "max_blocks": 8,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "The cake" },
    { "type": "html", "id": "title", "label": "Title (small — use <em> for the italic accent)", "default": "A <em>Réunion</em> recipe, packed for the mountain." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "location", "label": "Location line", "default": "Réunion · Indian Ocean" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Monument photograph" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "One big, landscape image — the island, the volcano, the interior. It fills the top of the page behind the title." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photograph" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_caption", "label": "Caption / credit" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Body" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "standfirst", "label": "Standfirst", "default": "Sweet potato cake — gâteau patate douce — is an everyday dessert on Réunion Island. This is one family's version, baked denser and carried where the roads stop." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Pull quote" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "quote", "label": "Quote", "default": "Made on the island, for the parts of the island without roads." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quote_by", "label": "Attribution (optional)" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "chapter", "name": "Chapter", "settings": [
      { "type": "text", "id": "kicker", "label": "Kicker", "default": "Origin" },
      { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Heading" },
      { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body", "default": "<p>A paragraph or two.</p>" },
      { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photograph" },
      { "type": "text", "id": "image_caption", "label": "Caption" }
    ]}
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "MP Story", "blocks": [
    { "type": "chapter", "settings": {
      "kicker": "Origin",
      "heading": "From Réunion",
      "body": "<p>Réunion is a volcanic island in the Indian Ocean, French since the 1600s and Creole in its kitchen. Sweet potato grows well in its uplands, and gâteau patate douce — a moist, barely sweet cake — turns up at Sunday tables, school fêtes and church halls across the island.</p><p>Our recipe came off one of those tables. It was written for a family, not a bakery: roasted sweet potato, eggs, vanilla, a little flour, baked long and slow.</p>",
      "image_caption": "The uplands, Cirque de Salazie"
    }},
    { "type": "chapter", "settings": {
      "kicker": "The recipe",
      "heading": "Built to travel",
      "body": "<p>We changed two things. We roast the sweet potatoes whole so the sugars concentrate and the crumb holds together, and we bake each cake small enough to fit a jersey pocket or a vest.</p><p>What did not change: no shortcuts, no preservatives, the same vanilla these islands have grown for generations. A cake keeps ten days at room temperature and takes heat, cold and a full day of bouncing without falling apart.</p>",
      "image_caption": "One cake, one pocket"
    }},
    { "type": "chapter", "settings": {
      "kicker": "On the mountain",
      "heading": "La Diagonale des Fous",
      "body": "<p>La Diagonale des Fous — the Madmen's Diagonal — runs roughly 165 km across Réunion, coast to coast over the volcano, with about 9,500 metres of climbing. It is the island's race.</p><p>Cakes from this recipe have been carried at aid stations along the route. Thirty hours in, when gels stop working, a slice of something a runner grew up eating still goes down. That is the whole idea.</p>",
      "image_caption": "Aid station, Cilaos"
    }}
  ]}]
}
{% endschema %}
